    Bug 1958547 - Port bug 1951832: Fixed tests broken by white space normalization changes. r=vineet

    Changes made in bug 1951832 caused these tests to break:

      -     comm/mail/test/browser/composition/browser_paragraph_state.js
      -     comm/mail/test/browser/composition/browser_remove_text_styling.js
      -     comm/mail/test/browser/composition/browser_text_styling.js

    We had tried to work around it in bug 1955047 but that caused issues for users.

    This fix means that we don't need the workaround

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D244488

